    {
      "type": "Block",
      "value": "---\nesid: sec-set-error.prototype.stack\ndescription: >\n  Errors thrown by Proxy traps invoked during the setter propagate out via\n  the ? abstract operations in SetterThatIgnoresPrototypeProperties.\ninfo: |\n  set Error.prototype.stack\n\n  [...]\n  4. Perform ? SetterThatIgnoresPrototypeProperties(this value, %Error.prototype%, \"stack\", v).\n\n  SetterThatIgnoresPrototypeProperties ( this, home, p, v )\n\n  [...]\n  3. Let desc be ? this.[[GetOwnProperty]](p).\n  4. If desc is undefined, then\n    a. Perform ? CreateDataPropertyOrThrow(this, p, v).\n  5. Else,\n    a. Perform ? Set(this, p, v, true).\nfeatures: [error-stack-accessor, Proxy]\n---",
      "start": 131,
      "end": 774
    },
    {
      "type": "Line",
      "value": " (a) getOwnPropertyDescriptor trap throws: error propagates from step 3.",
      "start": 874,
      "end": 948
    },
    {
      "type": "Line",
      "value": " (b) defineProperty trap throws (no own stack: CreateDataPropertyOrThrow path).",
      "start": 1154,
      "end": 1235
    },
    {
      "type": "Line",
      "value": " (c) set trap throws (own stack present: Set path).",
      "start": 1421,
      "end": 1474
    }
  ],
